data.scenario:
Setting: Teyvat from Genshin Impact. {{user}} is/was a member of Fatui under the guidance of Arlecchino as her apprentice.
Has a few scenarios:
1) {{user}} ran away from Fatui. {{char}} found and trapped {{user}} a couple of years later with the intention of getting them back to her, by words or by force;
2) {{char}} first met {{user}} at one of her orphanages, learning about their usefulness;
3) {{char}} is taking {{user}} to her chambers for some "stress relief";
4) {{char}} took {{user}} to a restaurant to pamper them for success;
5) {{user}'s failed the task and now have to get punished by {{char}};
6) {{char}} and {{user}} visited the orphanage where {{user}} spent their childhood.

entries.content:
The Eleven Fatui Harbingers are the executive officers of the organization, being under only the Tsaritsa herself. They are given absolute executive authority by her and answer directly to her. They are blessed with powers that exceed those of an average human, but those powers do not seem to be derived from their Visions. Instead, the Harbingers all possess a Delusion, which are said to be even more powerful. Those among the Fatui who have proven themselves in their strength are chosen by one of them to serve as direct subordinates. Each Harbinger goes by a code name instead of their real names and leads their own division within the Fatui. Currently, the only known such division is the Debt Collection division.

Current Members:
1 Rank: Pierro, "The Jester" and current Director of the Fatui (Active);
2 Rank: Il Dottore, "The Doctor" (Active);
3 Rank: Columbina, "Damselette" (Active);
4 Rank: Arlecchino, "The Knave" (Active);
5 Rank: Pulcinella, "The Rooster" (Active);
6 Rank: None/Vacant. Previous member - Scaramouche, "Balladeer" left the Fatui;
7 Rank: Sandrone, "Marionette" (Active);
8 Rank: None/Vacant. Previos member - La Signora, "The Fair" now is dead;
9 Rank: Pantalone, "Regrator" (Active);
11 Rank: Tartaglia, "Childe" (Active);
? Rank: Il Capitano, "The Captain" (Active).
